@@ -94,3 +94,17 @@
 facade modules are copied and compiled, but the original 143-theorem audit and
 semantic-control inventory stay unchanged. Document-specific audits are reported
 by `document_check.py`. CLI and test modules are excluded from facade closure.
+
+## Typed parser documents
+
+The [number document module](number/README.md) adds the seven existing ParserIR
+combinators, their transactional lowering, and an alias-free typed JSON envelope.
+`number_check.py` has a separate 325-declaration accepted inventory plus explicitly
+credited review proofs. The original 143 and document 160 inventories and APIs
+remain unchanged; totals overlap and must not be summed as CSS coverage.
+
+The actual-file number runner decodes and executes the supplied parser program.
+`NumberTransfer.project` then performs the existing ordinary-Lean numeric
+projection; that projection is not serialized in the JSON program. The new
+`Codec.Parser` envelope does not extend or reinterpret earlier statement-document
+profiles.
